# Language rows, cards (TC-023, TC-024, TC-025 … one per language): reads the six template cards in order.
# Starts: Cinematic Reel Creator template page just entered from the Launcher (card 1 centred), no sheet open.
# Ends: template page on card 6, no sheet open. Picks no photo, uses no credits.
# Args: $1 = case ID (names the screenshots). Each `shot` line closes one card's block of `els` output.
# The pager only moves with `drag` (not fingerdrag); the centred card's texts are the tv_title / tv_description at x=187.
# Called by lang-check.ts, which parses the output and compares it with the row.
els tv_
shot $1-card1
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
els tv_
shot $1-card2
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
els tv_
shot $1-card3
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
els tv_
shot $1-card4
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
els tv_
shot $1-card5
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
els tv_
shot $1-card6
